REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_AKR1D1 - AKR1D1 delta4-3-oxosteroid 5b-reductase after HSD3B7 classical BA close
# Continuum ...->pepf->pdf->map->nata->natb->natc->nate->mete->metk->ahcy->cbs->cgl->gsha->gshb->gor->gpx->gst->ggt->dug1->nat8->cdo1->csad->fmo1->baat->bsep->ntcp->oatp1b1->mrp2->mrp3->ost->asbt->fabp6->fxr->fgf19->fgfr4->klb->shp->cyp7a1->cyp8b1->hsd3b7->akr1d1
# Gift: HSD3B7 after CYP8B1 so classical BA free-energy can authorize 3beta-HSD/Delta5-4 isomerization under ASSERT.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow.

